GIT PULL
========

Download changes from remote repository.


BASIC
-----
git pull

Gets latest changes from the remote and merges them.


WHAT IT DOES
------------
• Downloads new commits
• Updates your local branch
• Merges changes automatically


WHEN TO USE
-----------
Before you start working each day.
When others pushed new code.


OPTIONS
-------
Pull specific branch:
  git pull origin main

Pull without merge:
  git pull --rebase


ERRORS
------
"merge conflict"     → Fix conflicts manually
"no remote"          → Add remote first
"uncommitted changes" → Commit or stash first
